--- !u!114 &1709852090
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1709852081}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 40fe67fde4a4351409089804b4848b92, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _documentationText: 'Facial Expression Recognition Example

    Detects faces
    with YuNetV2 and classifies facial expressions on each detected face region,

    with
    optional Unity Sentis or OpenCV DNN frameworks for expression recognition.

    

    Demonstrates:

    -
    Reading input frames via MultiSourceToMatHelper (webcam, video file, image file,
    or GPU readback)

    - Loading YuNet and expression-recognition ONNX/Sentis
    models from StreamingAssets

    - Toggling Sentis vs OpenCV DNN for expression
    recognition and optional async two-stage inference

    - Converting RGBA frames
    to BGR and visualizing face boxes and expression labels

    

    OpenCV classes
    and APIs used:

    - Mat, Size, Scalar, Point

    - Imgproc: cvtColor

    -
    YuNetV2FaceDetector, FacialExpressionRecognizerMultiBackend, MatSingleFlightSyncAsyncRunner,
    MultiBackendDnn

    - MultiSourceToMatHelper, OpenCVMatUnityUtils

    

    Referring
    to:

    https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/master/models/facial_expression_recognition

    

    [Tested
    Models]

    facial_expression_recognition_mobilefacenet_2022july.onnx https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/blob/main/models/facial_expression_recognition/facial_expression_recognition_mobilefacenet_2022july.onnx

    face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx
    https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/blob/main/models/face_recognition/face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx'
  AlignmentSetting: 0
